{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DLxY5KaP6yQ159YyVqwHHj","type":"tool_result","content":".claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py:760:def _ensure_canonical_lib_modules() -> Optional[str]:\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-761-    \"\"\"PLAN-118 AC-B4 — canonical-resolution check for producer modules.\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-762-\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-763-    Walks :data:`sys.modules` for ``_lib.audit_emit`` / ``_lib.canonical_json``\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-764-    / ``_lib.audit_hmac``; for each module present, resolves its\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-765-    ``__file__`` to absolute and asserts the parent matches\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-766-    :data:`_CANONICAL_LIB_DIR`. On mismatch raises\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-767-    :class:`AuditProducerPathPollutionError` with an 8-hex-prefix payload\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-768-    (NO raw path echo). On clean state returns the matched ``reason_code``\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-769-    for the producer (callers use this for AC-B5 breadcrumb emission).\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-770-\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-771-    Bounded ~5us per call (3 dict lookups + ≤3 :meth:`Path.resolve` calls).\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-772-    Called from chokepoints 1/3 in ``audit_emit.py``, chokepoint 4 in\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-773-    ``spool_writer.py`` _phase4_build_batch, and chokepoint 5 here at\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-774-    :func:`compute_entry_hmac` entry.\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-775-    \"\"\"\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-776-    import sys as _sys\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-777-    for mod_name in _CANONICAL_LIB_MODULES:\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-778-        mod = _sys.modules.get(mod_name)\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-779-        if mod is None:\n.claude/hooks/_lib/audit_hmac.py-780-            # Module not yet imported by this process. compute_entr